000010* COMP-1 and COMP-2: arithmetic, MOVE both ways, comparisons,
000020* DISPLAY in C's %G form, and FUNCTION RANDOM (a COMP-2 result),
000030* compared with stock GnuCOBOL.
000040 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000050 PROGRAM-ID. FLOATS.
000060 DATA DIVISION.
000070 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
000080 01 F1             COMP-1.
000090 01 F2             COMP-2.
000100 01 F3             COMP-2.
000110 01 D              PIC -9(3).9(6).
000120 01 BIG            PIC 9(15) VALUE 123456789012345.
000130 01 TINY           PIC V9(9) VALUE .000012345.
000140 01 N              PIC S9(5)V99.
000150 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
000160 MAIN-PARA.
000170     DISPLAY "INIT     " F1 " " F2
000180     COMPUTE F2 = 1 / 3
000190     MOVE F2 TO D
000200     DISPLAY "THIRD    " F2 " " D
000210     MOVE 2.5 TO F1
000220     ADD F1 TO F2
000230     DISPLAY "ADD      " F1 " " F2
000240     IF F2 > 2 DISPLAY "COMPARE  BIG" END-IF
000250     COMPUTE F2 = F2 * -1000
000260     DISPLAY "NEG      " F2
000270     MOVE BIG TO F2
000280     DISPLAY "LARGE    " F2
000290     COMPUTE F2 = F2 * 1000000
000300     DISPLAY "HUGE     " F2
000310     MOVE TINY TO F2
000320     DISPLAY "SMALL    " F2
000330     COMPUTE F2 = F2 / 1000
000340     DISPLAY "SMALLER  " F2
000350     MOVE 0.1 TO F1
000360     COMPUTE F3 = F1
000370     DISPLAY "0.1 AS 1 " F1 " " F3
000380     COMPUTE F2 = 2 ** 0.5
000390     DISPLAY "ROOT 2   " F2
000400     MOVE F2 TO N
000410     DISPLAY "TO FIXED " N
000420     COMPUTE F1 = 1 / 7
000430     DISPLAY "SEVENTH  " F1
000440     COMPUTE F2 = 1 / 7
000450     DISPLAY "SEVENTH  " F2
000460     MOVE -0.5 TO F2
000470     DISPLAY "HALF     " F2
000480     DISPLAY "RANDOM   " FUNCTION RANDOM(5)
000490     DISPLAY "RANDOM   " FUNCTION RANDOM
000500     COMPUTE F2 = FUNCTION RANDOM * 100
000510     DISPLAY "RANDOM   " F2
000520     DISPLAY "RESEED   " FUNCTION RANDOM(5)
000530     STOP RUN.
